  "question": {
    "text": "Wires 1 and 2 carrying currents $i_1$ and $i_2$ respectively are inclined at an angle $\\theta$ to each other. What is the force on a small element dl of wire 2 at a distance of $\\mathrm{r}$ from wire 1 (as shown in the figure) due to the magnetic field of wire 1 ?\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/Jb7LCZ6WVoD9dsYNbgDRzEAKoybyz9M3ZLEquwjojug.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
